<?xml version="1.0"?>
<body language="English">
	<row id="msg_0657_00000" index="0">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Brock</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0657_00001" index="1">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Huh? I can’t hear you. The\nconnection trash.\rCall back from somewhere else!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0657_00002" index="2">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Wassup...\nWhat’s good?\fI’m doin’ great!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0657_00003" index="3">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Hmm... I’d like to scrap you again,\nbut I think there’s some Blocks you\fain’t hit yet, ain’t there?</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0657_00004" index="4">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">I can take a break Saturday\nevenings, if you wanna call\fagain then.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0657_00005" index="5">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Ayo, you called at the right time!\nI’m free right now.\fWanna scrap me again? {YESNO 0}</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0657_00006" index="6">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Aight, aight! I’m lookin’\nforward to it!\rI’ll meet you at\nthe Saffron Dojo!\rI WON’T be at the Pewter Block,\naight? Don’t get confused!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0657_00007" index="7">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Is that so...\nWell, I guess you got a lotta\fstuff to do yourself...</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0657_00008" index="8">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Yeah, I’d deadass like to scrap you\nagain... But I think you got\fplans with somebody else?\rOnce you handle your business\nwith the other Hustlers,\fthen call me again!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0657_00009" index="9">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">I’ll be waitin’ for you at\nthe Saffron Dojo.\fIt’s a promise between Hustlers!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0657_00010" index="10">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">This Brock.\nOh ayo, how you doin’?\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0657_00011" index="11">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">We made plans to scrap at\nthe Saffron Dojo, right?\fYou ain’t forget, did you?</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0657_00012" index="12">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A big earthquake hit recently.\nSome walls in my Block\fcrumbled a bit.\rWell, I guess that’s just the kinda\nthing my Block known for.\rSo even if the walls crumbled,\nnobody would deadass notice!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0657_00013" index="13">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">There’s SO many kinds of\nhomies in the world. Like you\fcould guess, I like Rock types best.\rThey solid and rough, but\nkinda brittle at the same time.\fOnce you deadass get to know\f’em, they even kinda cute.\rWhat you think?</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0657_00014" index="14">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Every town’s Block is different!\nThe design, the tricks, everythin’ is\fdifferent. It’s interestin’!\rEvery Block Boss the Big League\nput in charge of a Block gets to\fdesign it however they want.\rOf course, Pewter Block’s design is my\npride and joy!\rThe tricks ain’t much, but you can’t\ndeny when you walk in, the design\fhit you HARD, right?</language>
	</row>
</body>
